+Use the SHA3 instructions for Keccak-p[1600, 12]x2 on ARMv8A
+
+With __ARM_FEATURE_SHA3, KeccakP1600times2_PermuteAll_24rounds uses the NEON+SHA3 core from
+mlkem-native, but PermuteAll_12rounds still used the pure-NEON round loop, which is ~2x slower.
+Let the SHA3 core take the number of rounds, and use it for 12 rounds too.
